Subject: [PATCH 6/8] sbr_hfgen: prediction coefficients and the patch recursion four bands at a time

VibeSDR patch for FAAD2 2.11.3 (the plain build VibeServer links for DAB+ audio, libfaad_dab.a). GPL-2.0-or-later,
as FAAD2. Written for VibeSDR, 2026-10-26; applied by vibeserver/linux/build-deps.sh and vibeserver/mac/build-deps.sh
in the order of faad2-patches/series. Measured on real off-air DAB+ unit logs (HE-AAC v2, 21 logs, 1909 s):
output against stock FAAD2 2.11.3 built with its own flags — see each header for the figures.

The covariance sums behind calc_prediction_coef for four adjacent source bands at once (the same sums in the same
order per lane), the coefficients from them exactly as calc_prediction_coef computes them, filled before patching
(any band not covered is computed by the stock call); and the patch's second-order recursion for four adjacent target
bands at once where all four are filtered (bw^2 > 0), each lane with its own a0/a1.

